text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker with, so every event the tracker tracks carries the key, through any copy of it:"}]},{"code":["let tracker = Tracker(enrichers: [.sessions()])"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Inactivity is measured between records’ timestamps, the time each event was tracked, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not when the tracker’s worker reaches it. So the app returning from the background past the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"timeout starts a new session with its first event, such as ","type":"text"},{"code":"ApplicationOpened","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" (module","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"LifecycleTracking","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), and one returning sooner goes on with the same.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The first event the tracker tracks starts the first session: ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionStarted","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" comes","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"before it, stamped with its time. A session ends only when an event comes after the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"timeout: ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionEnded","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", stamped with the time of the session’s last event, then","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionStarted","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", stamped with the new event’s, come before that event. So a run’s last","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"session ends with no ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Sessions\/documentation\/Sessions\/SessionEnded","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":": a destination takes its end from its last event. Each","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"session event carries the key of the session it starts or ends, and the context the event","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"that ended the session had when this enricher reached it; the enrichers after this one run","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"on them too. Their call site is this call’s.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A session’s identifier is a random UUID, never derived from anything, held in this"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"enricher’s memory and nowhere else: neither a store nor anything else writes it to disk,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and a new enricher, as on the next launch, starts with a new session. Records a store"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"kept from an earlier run aren’t enriched again, so they carry no key."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The enricher’s sessions are its own, created by this call: give each tracker its own call.","type":"text"}]},{"name":"Precondition","type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"timeout"},{"type":"text","text":" is more than zero."}]}]}]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/sessions\/trackers\/enricher\/sessions(timeout:kinds:file:fileid:function:line:column:)"]}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"role":"symbol","extendedModule":"Trackers","remoteSource":{"fileName":"Enricher+Sessions.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Sessions\/Enricher+Sessions.swift#L49"},"modules":[{"relatedModules":["Trackers"],"name":"Sessions"}],"fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"